  "body": "While we inform clients about new E2EE devices on their account, I don't believe we have a way for servers to push clients when new OIDC logins happen.  This means users won't be told if someone adds a non-E2EE device on their account.\n\nSee also https://github.com/element-hq/element-meta/issues/2930",
